{"name":"Blazing","hex":"#e94e41","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"blazing","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of blaze"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Very fast.","Sexually attractive."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/blazing"}],"entries":[{"title":"Diffraction grating","blocks":[{"text":"In optics, a diffraction grating is a grating with a periodic structure of appropriate scale so as to diffract light, or another type of electromagnetic radiation, into several beams traveling in different directions known as diffracted orders. The emerging coloration is a form of structural coloration. The directions or diffraction angles of these beams depend on the wave (light) incident angle to the diffraction grating, the spacing or periodic distance between adjacent diffracting elements on the grating, and the wavelength of the incident light. Because the grating acts as a dispersive element, diffraction gratings are commonly used in monochromators and spectrometers, but other applications are also possible such as optical encoders for high-precision motion control and wavefront measurement."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2a/Diffraction_grating.jpg/330px-Diffraction_grating.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diffraction_grating"},{"title":"Cannabis smoking","blocks":[{"text":"Cannabis smoking is the inhalation of smoke or vapor released by heating the flowers, leaves, or extracts of cannabis and releasing the main psychoactive chemical, Δ9-tetrahydrocannabinol (THC), which is absorbed into the bloodstream via the lungs. Archaeological evidence indicates cannabis with high levels of THC was smoked at least 2,500 years ago. As of 2021, cannabis is the most commonly consumed federally illegal drug in the United States, with 36.4 million people consuming it on a monthly basis. Smoking cannabis has been shown to be harmful to the health of the smoker, and may also be harmful to others through passive smoking."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Ganja_Smoking_-_Gangasagar_Fair_Transit_Camp_-_Kolkata_2013-01-12_2646.JPG/330px-Ganja_Smoking_-_Gangasagar_Fair_Transit_Camp_-_Kolkata_2013-01-12_2646.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cannabis_smoking"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/An_incandescent_light-bulb_viewed_through_a_transmissive_diffraction_grating.jpg/250px-An_incandescent_light-bulb_viewed_through_a_transmissive_diffraction_grating.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/af/An_incandescent_light-bulb_viewed_through_a_transmissive_diffraction_grating.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/An_incandescent_light-bulb_viewed_through_a_transmissive_diffraction_grating.jpg/250px-An_incandescent_light-bulb_viewed_through_a_transmissive_diffraction_grating.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An incandescent light bulb viewed through a diffractive effects filter.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAn_incandescent_light-bulb_viewed_through_a_transmissive_diffraction_grating.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Difraction_grating_reflecting_green_light.JPG/500px-Difraction_grating_reflecting_green_light.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Difraction_grating_reflecting_green_light.JPG/1280px-Difraction_grating_reflecting_green_light.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Difraction_grating_reflecting_green_light.JPG/500px-Difraction_grating_reflecting_green_light.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A blazed diffraction grating reflecting only the green portion of the spectrum from a room's fluorescent lighting","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADifraction_grating_reflecting_green_light.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Mehrfachspalt-Numerisch.png/500px-Mehrfachspalt-Numerisch.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Mehrfachspalt-Numerisch.png/1280px-Mehrfachspalt-Numerisch.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Mehrfachspalt-Numerisch.png/500px-Mehrfachspalt-Numerisch.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Intensity as heatmap for monochromatic light behind a grating","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AMehrfachspalt-Numerisch.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Helical_fluorescent_lamp_spectrum_by_diffraction_grating.JPG/500px-Helical_fluorescent_lamp_spectrum_by_diffraction_grating.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Helical_fluorescent_lamp_spectrum_by_diffraction_grating.JPG/1280px-Helical_fluorescent_lamp_spectrum_by_diffraction_grating.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/22/Helical_fluorescent_lamp_spectrum_by_diffraction_grating.JPG/500px-Helical_fluorescent_lamp_spectrum_by_diffraction_grating.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A helical fluore